        "field_path": [
          "review_planning_B",
          "scope_interpretation_cautions"
        ],
        "value": "文中提到的许多机制（如cdAMP, SagA）主要在小鼠模型中验证，其在人体内的确切效力和安全性仍需更多临床数据支持。",
        "role": "evidence",
        "snapshot_ids": [
          "snapshot::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea",
          "snapshot::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f09"
